{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55729","headline":"住山後作（题从《小草斋诗话》卷四） · 义存","name":"住山後作（题从《小草斋诗话》卷四）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"光阴倏忽（《小草斋诗话》作「迅速」）暂须臾，浮世那（《小草斋诗话》作「何」）能得久居。\n出岭年登（《祖庭事苑》卷四作「始年」）三十二，入闽（《祖庭事苑》作「如今」）蚤是四旬余。\n他非不用频频检（《祖庭事苑》、《小草斋诗话》作「举」），已过还（《祖庭事苑》作「当」）须旋旋除。\n爲报满朝（《小草斋诗话》作「报与满朝」）朱紫道，阎王（《祖庭事苑》作「罗」）不怕佩金鱼。\n（按：《语录》原缺题。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"义存","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55729.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55729","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}